K-1CA0nLhdwd0T4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GNwnHHsXt4W7XFJ42HIrllQdSE60yeLlZwFG7eFLRLQ&oe=6A2043E3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultimate Soccer - VR Football World Cup", "keywords": ["Soccer", "Football", "FootballWorldCup", "FootballMatch", "SoccerSports"], "long_description": "Step onto the field and feel the excitement of real football action in Ultimate Soccer - VR Football World Cup!\n\nExperience immersive VR soccer gameplay where you can kick, pass, score goals, and compete in thrilling World Cup-style football matches. Play like a true football star and enjoy realistic stadium environments, exciting gameplay, and action-packed moments designed for virtual reality.\n\nChoose your favorite team, master your shooting skills, and challenge yourself in fast-paced soccer matches. Whether you love football games, penalty kicks, or competitive sports simulations, Ultimate Soccer delivers the ultimate VR football experience.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\u26bd Immersive VR Football Gameplay\nFeel like a real soccer player with exciting VR controls and realistic action.\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 World Cup Football Experience\nCompete in thrilling tournament-style matches and chase championship glory.\n\n\ud83e\udd45 Score Incredible Goals\nUse your skills to shoot, pass, and dominate the field.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Realistic Stadium Atmosphere\nPlay in detailed football arenas with immersive crowd environments.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Easy Controls & Fun Gameplay\nPerfect for casual players and football fans alike.\n\n\u26a1 Fast-Paced Soccer Action\nEnjoy exciting matches packed with challenges and competitive gameplay.\n\nIf you love VR football games, soccer simulators, World Cup games, or sports VR experiences, then Ultimate Soccer is the perfect game for you.", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of the World Cup in VR! Score amazing goals, compete in exciting football matches, and become the ultimate 